# Allow-list: everything is excluded, then only what the Dockerfile copies is let back in.
# This keeps participant messages, labelling sheets, evaluation images, results and local tools out of any image.
*
!Dockerfile
!requirements-lock.txt
!src/
!scripts/download_models.py
!scripts/m12_retrieval/m12_3_normalizer.py
!frontend/
!data/corpus/mock_facebook_corpus.jsonl
!data/corpus/independent_announcements.jsonl
!data/corpus/dev2_announcements.jsonl
!data/source_map.csv
!data/dev/sample_claims.csv
**/__pycache__
